@startuml 04-companion-chat-sequence-as-is

' Model: As-Is
' UE baseline: dead903156946ec6956342f02d587612baab1717
' AI service baseline: f548c1ad64c5d284eace084132616d171d45403f
' Evidence: UE-CHAT-BP-CONSTRUCT-001, UE-CHAT-BP-SEND-001,
'           UE-CHAT-BP-REPLY-001, UE-CHAT-BP-ERROR-001,
'           UE-CHAT-BP-CLOSE-001, UE-CHAT-001, PY-API-CHAT-001,
'           PY-COMPANION-001

title 陪伴文本聊天时序（As-Is）

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FE
  BorderColor #315A93
  FontColor #172554
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #F8E7C4
  BorderColor #8A5A20
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DB
  BorderColor #9A7B16
}

actor 玩家 as Player
boundary "WBP_CompanionChatTest" as Widget
control "UCompanionChatSubsystem" as ChatSubsystem
boundary "POST /v1/companion/chat" as ChatApi
control "dialogue_service" as DialogueService
database "primary_companion.yaml" as Profile

group Widget 初始化
  Widget -> ChatSubsystem : Get Game Instance Subsystem
  Widget -> ChatSubsystem : Bind OnReplyReceived → OnChatReply
  Widget -> ChatSubsystem : Bind OnRequestFailed → OnChatError
end

Player -> Widget : 点击 SendButton
Widget -> Widget : 读取 InputMessage.Text
Widget -> Widget : DebugText = “正在等待 Alice 回复……”
Widget -> Widget : ErrorText = 空文本
Widget -> ChatSubsystem : SendChatMessage(Text)

ChatSubsystem -> ChatSubsystem : Trim；校验非空且长度 ≤ 50

alt 本地校验或请求创建失败
  ChatSubsystem --> Widget : OnRequestFailed(Error)
  Widget -> Widget : ErrorText = Error
else 请求成功启动
  ChatSubsystem ->> ChatApi : HTTP POST\ntext / companion.alice / exploration
  ChatSubsystem --> Widget : SendChatMessage 返回
  Widget -> Widget : InputMessage.Text = 空文本

  ChatApi -> DialogueService : create_dialogue_reply(Request)
  DialogueService -> Profile : 读取 Alice 人设与默认回复
  Profile --> DialogueService : CompanionProfile
  DialogueService --> ChatApi : CompanionDialogueResponse
  ChatApi -->> ChatSubsystem : HTTP JSON Response

  alt 网络、HTTP、JSON 或必要字段错误
    ChatSubsystem --> Widget : OnRequestFailed(Error)
    Widget -> Widget : ErrorText = Error
  else 响应合法
    ChatSubsystem --> Widget : OnReplyReceived(CompanionChatReply)
    Widget -> Widget : Break CompanionChatReply
    Widget -> Widget : AliceReplyText = ReplyText
    Widget -> Widget : DebugText = Emotion / Gesture / Face / Source
    Widget -> Widget : ErrorText = 空文本
  end
end

opt 玩家点击 CloseButton
  Player -> Widget : CloseButton.OnClicked
  Widget -> Widget : GetOwningPlayer\nCast AAesirCombatPrototypePlayerController
  Widget -> Widget : CloseCompanionChat
end

note over Widget,ChatSubsystem
  当前 Widget 只实现文本陪伴聊天。
  没有语音采集、命令解析、战术决策或订单提交节点。
end note

note over ChatSubsystem,ChatApi
  UE 当前 ServiceBaseUrl：127.0.0.1:8001
  后端文档默认端口：8000（GAP-001）
end note

@enduml
